{
  "_comment": [
    "M7.1 fixture: three physical ports, one enslaved to an existing bridge.",
    "",
    "This fixture exists to separate two conditions that are easy to conflate:",
    "an interface that is merely not in use, and an interface that has already",
    "been given to something. A free port can be offered; an enslaved one has",
    "to be un-enslaved by a person first.",
    "",
    "port_a is physical Ethernet with a master. It is real hardware and it is",
    "not available for a new role until somebody resolves the bridge. The",
    "analysis must say both things and must not quietly pick it."
  ],
